  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Finely chop garlic, celery, carrot and brown onion.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-b9579a00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, celery and onion, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add veggies mince, breaking up with a spoon, until browned, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add garlic and Italian herbs and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• TIP: For best results, drain the oil from the pan before cooking the sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-b8bf6310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the brown sugar, diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, chicken stock pot (see ingredients) and the water. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-37615120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the ragu is simmering, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil in a separate large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Add gnocchi in a single layer, tossing occasionally, until golden, 6-8 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: If the gnocchi doesn't fit in a single layer, cook in batches so it becomes golden. Add extra olive oil if necessary.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-a6bafe30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add gnocchi and baby spinach leaves to the beef & pork ragu. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-ec925f40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Italian beef & pork ragu and gnocchi between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.\n• Tear over parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f87b5dcade9b9f0acf61a1/step-48f61350.jpg"
    }
  ]
